        "text": "Starting tomorrow (Oct. 1), Onyeka Okongwu is eligible for a contract extension up to 3 years and $76.6 million total.\n\nIt's a short window, though.\n\nOnly eligible to extend until Oct. 19, then the door closes again.\n\n(In contrast, Lu Dort is extension-eligible all season)",
